Chr4	Araport11	gene	9402898	9406136	.	+	.	ID=AT4G16730;Name=AT4G16730;Note=terpene synthase 02;curator_summary=In the Col ecotype%2C no functional protein is encoded at this locus due to the presence of a two-base (AT) insertion 184 nucleotides  downstream of the start codon leading to a  frame shift and premature translational termination. However%2C in the Ws ecotype%2C a functional terpene synthase that localizes to the chloroplast is encoded at this locus. It can catalyze the synthesis of (E)-beta-ocimene and (E%2CE)-alpha farnesene in vitro%2C but%2C it has more activity as an (E)-beta-ocimene synthase activity in vivo. This may reflect the greater availability of the GPP precursor of (E)-beta-ocimene than of the FPP precursor of (E%2CE)-alpha-farnesene in the chloroplasts where the Ws TPS02 is present.;symbol=TPS02;full_name=terpene synthase 02;computational_description=terpene synthase 02 (TPS02)%3B INVOLVED IN: metabolic process%3B EXPRESSED IN: sepal%2C carpel%2C stamen%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 4 anthesis%2C petal differentiation and expansion stage%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Terpene synthase%2C metal-binding domain (InterPro:IPR005630)%2C Terpenoid synthase (InterPro:IPR008949)%2C Terpenoid cylases/protein prenyltransferase alpha-alpha toroid (InterPro:IPR008930)%2C Terpene synthase-like (InterPro:IPR001906)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: terpene synthase 03 (TAIR:AT4G16740.1)%3B Has 1736 Blast hits to 1706 proteins in 177 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 2%3B Metazoa - 0%3B Fungi - 0%3B Plants - 1730%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 4 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:12566586,PMID:12777052,PMID:15918888,PMID:16297850,PMID:16805732,PMID:17640338,PMID:18398052,PMID:20463089,locus:2129091;locus_type=protein_coding
Chr4	Araport11	mRNA	9402898	9406136	.	+	.	ID=AT4G16730.1;Parent=AT4G16730;Name=AT4G16730.1;Note=terpene synthase 02;curator_summary=In the Col ecotype%2C no functional protein is encoded at this locus due to the presence of a two-base (AT) insertion 184 nucleotides  downstream of the start codon leading to a  frame shift and premature translational termination. However%2C in the Ws ecotype%2C a functional terpene synthase that localizes to the chloroplast is encoded at this locus. It can catalyze the synthesis of (E)-beta-ocimene and (E%2CE)-alpha farnesene in vitro%2C but%2C it has more activity as an (E)-beta-ocimene synthase activity in vivo. This may reflect the greater availability of the GPP precursor of (E)-beta-ocimene than of the FPP precursor of (E%2CE)-alpha-farnesene in the chloroplasts where the Ws TPS02 is present.;conf_class=6;symbol=TPS02;full_name=terpene synthase 02;computational_description=terpene synthase 02 (TPS02)%3B INVOLVED IN: metabolic process%3B EXPRESSED IN: sepal%2C carpel%2C stamen%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 4 anthesis%2C petal differentiation and expansion stage%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Terpene synthase%2C metal-binding domain (InterPro:IPR005630)%2C Terpenoid synthase (InterPro:IPR008949)%2C Terpenoid cylases/protein prenyltransferase alpha-alpha toroid (InterPro:IPR008930)%2C Terpene synthase-like (InterPro:IPR001906)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: terpene synthase 03 (TAIR:AT4G16740.1)%3B Has 1736 Blast hits to 1706 proteins in 177 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 2%3B Metazoa - 0%3B Fungi - 0%3B Plants - 1730%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 4 (source: NCBI BLink).;conf_rating=**;Dbxref=PMID:10700382,gene:2129090
