Chr4	Araport11	gene	9476069	9479878	.	+	.	ID=AT4G16845;Name=AT4G16845;Note=VEFS-Box of polycomb protein;curator_summary=The VERNALIZATION2 (VRN2) gene mediates vernalization and encodes a nuclear-localized zinc finger protein with similarity to Polycomb group (PcG) proteins of plants and animals. In wild-type Arabidopsis%2C vernalization results in the stable reduction of the levels of the floral repressor FLC. In vrn2 mutants%2C FLC expression is downregulated normally in response to vernalization%2C but instead of remaining low%2C FLC mRNA levels increase when plants are returned to normal temperatures. VRN2 maintains FLC repression after a cold treatment%2C serving as a mechanism for the cellular memory of vernalization. Required for complete repression of FLC. Required for the methylation of histone H3;symbol=VRN2;full_name=REDUCED VERNALIZATION RESPONSE 2;computational_description=REDUCED VERNALIZATION RESPONSE 2 (VRN2)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Polycomb protein%2C VEFS-Box (InterPro:IPR019135)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: VEFS-Box of polycomb protein (TAIR:AT5G51230.1)%3B Has 30201 Blast hits to 17322 proteins in 780 species: Archae - 12%3B Bacteria - 1396%3B Metazoa - 17338%3B Fungi - 3422%3B Plants - 5037%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2996 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:8998499,PMID:11118137,PMID:11719192,PMID:11546753,PMID:12730378,PMID:15456723,PMID:15016992,PMID:16236152,PMID:16549797,PMID:16527743,PMID:16507079,PMID:16778081,PMID:16983073,PMID:17174094,PMID:17709278,PMID:17980595,PMID:18650403,PMID:18775970,PMID:18854416,PMID:19304997,PMID:19368695,PMID:19704811,PMID:19825653,PMID:20084169,PMID:20585548,PMID:21127216,PMID:23271982,PMID:23619014,PMID:24377444,locus:3685330;locus_type=protein_coding
