Chr4	Araport11	gene	11769668	11772599	.	-	.	ID=AT4G22260;Name=AT4G22260;Note=Alternative oxidase family protein;curator_summary=Similar to mitochondrial alternative oxidase.  im mutants have a variegated phenotype and fail to differentiate chloroplasts in the majority of their cells under high light intensity continuous illumination. The white tissues of immutans accumulate phytoene%2C a non-colored C40 carotenoid intermediate. This suggests that immutans controls%2C either directly or indirectly%2C the activity of phytoene desaturase (PDS)%2C the enzyme that converts phytoene to zeta-carotene in higher plants. However%2C im is not the structural gene for PDS. It is located in the lumenar face of the thylakoid membrane. IM is expressed ubiquitously in plant tissues.;symbol=IM;Alias=IM1,PTOX,plastid terminal oxidase;full_name=IMMUTANS;computational_description=IMMUTANS (IM)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Alternative oxidase (InterPro:IPR002680)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: alternative oxidase 2 (TAIR:AT5G64210.1)%3B Has 30201 Blast hits to 17322 proteins in 780 species: Archae - 12%3B Bacteria - 1396%3B Metazoa - 17338%3B Fungi - 3422%3B Plants - 5037%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2996 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:10938359,PMID:10748104,PMID:9878632,PMID:9878631,PMID:9700076,PMID:7920709,PMID:11164375,PMID:11553735,PMID:12226428,PMID:14504923,PMID:12950262,PMID:15032871,PMID:16249174,PMID:16449381,PMID:16891546,PMID:17263779,PMID:17342448,PMID:18775970,PMID:19386811,PMID:19542226,PMID:19897671,PMID:20497376,PMID:21139430,PMID:22534126,PMID:23205022,PMID:23703455,PMID:24378845,PMID:25349324,locus:2005514;locus_type=protein_coding
