Chr4	Araport11	gene	13015250	13016235	.	-	.	ID=AT4G25470;Name=AT4G25470;Note=C-repeat/DRE binding factor 2;curator_summary=Encodes a member of the DREB subfamily A-1 of ERF/AP2 transcription factor family (CBF2). The protein contains one AP2 domain. There are six members in this subfamily%2C including CBF1%2C CBF2%2C and CBF3. This gene is involved in response to low temperature%2C abscisic acid%2C and circadian rhythm. Overexpressing this gene leads to increased freeze tolerance and induces the expression level of 85 cold-induced genes and reduces the expression level of 8 cold-repressed genes%2C which constitute the CBF2 regulon. Mutations in CBF2 increases the expression level of CBF1 and CBF3%2C suggesting that this gene may be involved in a negative regulatory or feedback circuit of the CBF pathway.;symbol=CBF2;Alias=ATCBF2,DREB1C,DRE/CRT-BINDING PROTEIN 1C,FTQ4,FREEZING TOLERANCE QTL 4;full_name=C-repeat/DRE binding factor 2;computational_description=C-repeat/DRE binding factor 2 (CBF2)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: DNA-binding%2C integrase-type (InterPro:IPR016177)%2C Pathogenesis-related transcriptional factor/ERF%2C DNA-binding (InterPro:IPR001471)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: C-repeat/DRE binding factor 1 (TAIR:AT4G25490.1)%3B Has 30201 Blast hits to 17322 proteins in 780 species: Archae - 12%3B Bacteria - 1396%3B Metazoa - 17338%3B Fungi - 3422%3B Plants - 5037%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2996 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:10330472,PMID:9952441,PMID:9881163,PMID:9735350,PMID:9707537,PMID:11118137,PMID:11914065,PMID:12032361,PMID:12177491,PMID:12172015,PMID:12165572,PMID:12376631,PMID:12647068,PMID:12609047,PMID:12672693,PMID:12753580,PMID:14500791,PMID:15004278,PMID:15144380,PMID:15247382,PMID:15383661,PMID:15356394,PMID:15500469,PMID:15497440,PMID:15488017,PMID:15479616,PMID:15634197,PMID:15598798,PMID:15728337,PMID:16258011,PMID:16244146,PMID:16231185,PMID:17416732,PMID:17559507,PMID:17965713,PMID:18093929,PMID:18088305,P