Chr4	Araport11	gene	15525979	15527926	.	-	.	ID=AT4G32150;Name=AT4G32150;Note=vesicle-associated membrane protein 711;curator_summary=AtVAMP711 is a member of Synaptobrevin-like AtVAMP7C%2C v-SNARE (soluble N-ethyl-maleimide sensitive factor attachment protein receptors) protein family. SNAREs have been divided into four subgroups: Qa-%2C Qb-%2C Qc- and R-SNAREs. R-SNAREs are classified into three groups%2C the Sec22-%2C YKT6- and VAMP7-like R-SNAREs. One R-SNARE and three Q-SNAREs (one of each subgroup) form the trans-SNARE complex%2C which governs specific membrane fusions.  VAMP7 proteins consist of three distinct domain%2C the N-terminal longin-domain (LD)%2C the SNARE motif (SNM) and a transmembrane domain. In spite of the high similarities among the VAMP7 proteins%2C they show different subcellular localizations. VAMP7C is vacuolar-localized and its LD is essential for the correct localization. Generally%2C it is suggested that the complete LD is the determinant of subcellular sorting in both animal and plant R-SNAREs.;symbol=VAMP711;Alias=ATVAMP711,vesicle-associated membrane protein 711;full_name=vesicle-associated membrane protein 711;computational_description=vesicle-associated membrane protein 711 (VAMP711)%3B INVOLVED IN: intermembrane transport%2C response to salt stress%2C cellular membrane fusion%2C response to abscisic acid stimulus%2C stomatal movement%3B LOCATED IN: vacuolar membrane%2C plasma membrane%2C vacuole%2C membrane%3B EXPRESSED IN: 24 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 15 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Longin (InterPro:IPR010908)%2C Longin-like (InterPro:IPR011012)%2C Synaptobrevin (InterPro:IPR001388)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: vesicle-associated membrane protein 713 (TAIR:AT5G11150.1)%3B Has 2432 Blast hits to 2430 proteins in 266 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 0%3B Metazoa - 955%3B Fungi - 502%3B Plants - 549%3B Viruses - 3%3B Other Eukaryotes - 423 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:11115874,PMID: