Chr4	Araport11	gene	15767185	15779697	.	+	.	ID=AT4G32700;Name=AT4G32700;Note=MUS308 and mammalian DNA polymerase-like protein;curator_summary=Encodes a homolog of Drosophila MUS308 and mammalian DNA polymerase%2C which prevent spontaneous or DNA damage-induced production of DNA double strand breaks. Two conserved functional domains: an N-terminal superfamily II DNA/RNA helicase domain and a C-terminal prokaryotic-type DNA polymerase I domain. Required for regulated cell division and differentiation in meristems. Mutant plants show morphological defects%2C such as short roots%2C serrated leaves%2C and fasciation%2C as well as defective patterns of cell division and differentiation in the meristem. Mutant plants had 2.5 to 4.5-fold higher expression of ATGR1%2C ATBRCA1 and RAD51 genes. TEB is required for normal  progression of DNA replication and for correct expression of genes during development.;computational_description=helicases%3BATP-dependent helicases%3Bnucleic acid binding%3BATP binding%3BDNA-directed DNA polymerases%3BDNA binding%3B FUNCTIONS IN: in 6 functions%3B INVOLVED IN: regulation of gene expression%2C DNA replication%2C DNA recombination%2C photomorphogenesis%3B EXPRESSED IN: 6 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: petal differentiation and expansion stage%2C E expanded cotyledon stage%2C D bilateral stage%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: DNA/RNA helicase%2C DEAD/DEAH box type%2C N-terminal (InterPro:IPR011545)%2C DEAD-like helicase%2C N-terminal (InterPro:IPR014001)%2C DNA-directed DNA polymerase%2C family A%2C palm domain (InterPro:IPR001098)%2C DNA/RNA helicase%2C C-terminal (InterPro:IPR001650)%2C DNA polymerase A domain (InterPro:IPR002298)%2C Helicase%2C superfamily 1/2%2C ATP-binding domain (InterPro:IPR014021)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: U5 small nuclear ribonucleoprotein helicase (TAIR:AT2G42270.1)%3B Has 17628 Blast hits to 16579 proteins in 2941 species: Archae - 600%3B Bacteria - 7507%3B Metazoa - 1254%3B Fungi - 1190%3B 