Chr4	Araport11	mRNA	16477136	16479506	.	-	.	ID=AT4G34460.3;Parent=AT4G34460;Name=AT4G34460.3;Note=GTP binding protein beta 1;curator_summary=Encodes the heterotrimeric G-protein beta subunit and is involved in organ shape. A significant fraction of the protein is found in the ER.  Mutants carrying null alleles express similar fruit phenotypes%2C as seen in er plants%2C but differ from er in that the stem is only slightly shorter than that in the wild type%2C the pedicel is slightly longer than that in the wild type%2C and the leaves are rounder than those in er mutants. Gene is expressed in all tissues examined%2C with highest expression level found in siliques. It is involved in resistance to Plectosphaerella cucumerina. The predicted protein has two DWD motifs. It can bind to DDB1a in Y2H assays and may be involved in the formation of a CUL4-based E3 ubiquitin ligase.  It seems to be involved in the calcium-mediated response to extracellular ATP.;conf_class=2;symbol=AGB1;Alias=ATAGB1,ELK4,ERECTA-LIKE 4;full_name=GTP binding protein beta 1;computational_description=GTP binding protein beta 1 (AGB1)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: protein binding%2C GTPase activity%2C nucleotide binding%3B INVOLVED IN: in 11 processes%3B LOCATED IN: endoplasmic reticulum%2C plasma membrane%2C CUL4 RING ubiquitin ligase complex%2C heterotrimeric G-protein complex%3B EXPRESSED IN: 26 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 14 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: WD40 repeat 2 (InterPro:IPR019782)%2C WD40 repeat%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR019775)%2C Guanine nucleotide-binding protein%2C beta subunit (InterPro:IPR016346)%2C WD40 repeat (InterPro:IPR001680)%2C G-protein%2C beta subunit (InterPro:IPR001632)%2C G-protein beta WD-40 repeat%2C region (InterPro:IPR020472)%2C WD40 repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR011046)%2C WD40-repeat-containing domain (InterPro:IPR017986)%2C WD40/YVTN repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR015943)%2C WD40 repeat%2C subgroup (InterPro:IPR019781)%3B B