Chr4	Araport11	gene	16560030	16563044	.	-	.	ID=AT4G34710;Name=AT4G34710;Note=arginine decarboxylase 2;curator_summary=encodes a arginine decarboxylase (ADC)%2C a rate-limiting enzyme that catalyzes the first step of polyamine (PA) biosynthesis via ADC pathway in Arabidopsis thaliana. Arabidopsis genome has two ADC paralogs%2C ADC1 and ADC2. ADC2 is stress-inducible (osmotic stress). Double mutant analysis showed that ADC genes are essential for the production of PA%2C and are required for normal seed development. Overexpression causes phenotypes similar to GA-deficient plants and these plants show reduced levels of GA due to lower expression levels of AtGA20ox1%2C AtGA3ox3 and AtGA3ox1.;symbol=ADC2;Alias=ATADC2,SPE2;full_name=arginine decarboxylase 2;computational_description=arginine decarboxylase 2 (ADC2)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Orn/DAP/Arg decarboxylase 2%2C C-terminal (InterPro:IPR022643)%2C Orn/DAP/Arg decarboxylase 2%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR022657)%2C Orn/DAP/Arg decarboxylase 2%2C pyridoxal-phosphate binding site (InterPro:IPR022653)%2C Ornithine/DAP/Arg decarboxylase (InterPro:IPR000183)%2C Arginine decarboxylase (InterPro:IPR002985)%2C Orn/DAP/Arg decarboxylase 2%2C N-terminal (InterPro:IPR022644)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: arginine decarboxylase 1 (TAIR:AT2G16500.1)%3B Has 7853 Blast hits to 7777 proteins in 2122 species: Archae - 112%3B Bacteria - 5255%3B Metazoa - 102%3B Fungi - 32%3B Plants - 645%3B Viruses - 2%3B Other Eukaryotes - 1705 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:10481069,PMID:9787437,PMID:9680979,PMID:11576438,PMID:11351099,PMID:12111553,PMID:12428010,PMID:14684170,PMID:15086823,PMID:15347784,PMID:15634198,PMID:15733873,PMID:16045477,PMID:18375607,PMID:18701673,PMID:18775970,PMID:19054359,PMID:19303315,PMID:20351290,PMID:20206537,PMID:23080295,PMID:25409942,locus:2139629;locus_type=protein_coding
